        <activityName xml:lang="en">Natural gas, from high pressure network (1-5 bar), at service station</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Natural gas, from high pressure network (1-5 bar), at service station
This data set includes electricity requirements of a service station as well as emissions from losses. The initial pressure of gas is from the high pressure network (1-5 bar). VOC emissions are calculated from gas losses and composition of Swiss natural gas.;
UUID: 0a60be73-22c5-394d-9aec-aaa550587c8b
This data set includes electricity requirements of a natural gas service station as well as emissions from losses.
Location: Data for Switzerland
Technology: Service station with high initial gas pressure (1-5 bar)
Time period: personal communication
Production volume: na
Sampling: personal communication 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_0a60be73-22c5-394d-9aec-aaa550587c8b.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
